	(text "SCP (J1850 PWM, EEC-V 16 = SCP+, 15 = SCP-): DRV8837 drives, TLV7031 receives. Passive state is IN1 = IN2 = LOW (coast," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 16.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "10e95495-7087-4432-a943-af56414cf537"))
	(text "Hi-Z) so another node can win arbitration; nSLEEP 10k low releases the whole bus at power-on. 100R per TX line." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 20.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5c15270a-4c02-4a81-9ab0-6e668b5d7c94"))
	(text "RX divider 100k:100k BOTH to GND (not 10k:100k, not to 3.3 V: the two OpenJ1850 traps), MM3Z3V3 clamps, 4.7M hysteresis." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 24.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b131910-50eb-4447-aa0f-d5d2e8016f46"))
